{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "b26bb0ffccf09ecc7e942e8e9bd169b0628a0abd184da42dcea3a864546fe4c8", "ja": "陰界戦戯（シャドウバウト）", "zh": "阴界战戏（Shadow Bout）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "cee2a52f5fde314178b714e36c64f0f900c5738343cecaa40bbfc99626de4ddc", "ja": "今夜のシャドウバウトは、深青書院の無敵の\n守護神・千早とヘリオトロープ工科学校の\n新人・静香による対決。千早は戦具を展開\nするが、静香の意表をついた一撃に敗れる。\nその様子を、ロコが取材していた。", "zh": "今晚的暗影决斗，是由深青书院无敌的\n守护神·千早对阵赫利俄特洛普工科学校的\n新人·静香。千早展开战具，却败在静香出其不意的一击下。\nROCO正在采访这场对决。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1000_se", "source_sha256": "a7c55e1fc0169ea4782244a3ef1a2807ecc7877fe66fa71b0c58901f6d3c59f1", "ja": "ブーーーーーーーーーッ！", "zh": "呜————————！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1001_mc", "source_sha256": "19d783e5507765bf19f2d55ab36f48869d57d6dece827e4d7c0eb6517de18138", "ja": "レディース、アンド、ジェントルメン！　今夜はついに\n深青書院（しんせいしょいん）の千早が登場だ！", "zh": "女士们，先生们！今晚终于轮到深青书院的千早登场了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1002_mc", "source_sha256": "816f7319c812819a257aeb1a7ba8a7c994edf16d4bcd4a27e49cde235fcf540c", "ja": "対するは、ヘリオトロープ工科学校のルーキー、静香！\n無敵の守護神を前に、勝ち目はあるのか？", "zh": "对手则是向日葵工科学校的新人，静香！\n面对无敌的守护神，她是否有胜算呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1003_025roc", "source_sha256": "46a0c7f325a1ffb2cceb0059e8eeda2b06549425aeff859f81ad958e8705cc01", "ja": "むむ……記者としてのインテューションが\n告げています！　この戦い、フォーカスですよ！", "zh": "嗯嗯……作为记者的直觉告诉我！这场战斗，值得关注！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1004_mc", "source_sha256": "26f4bc3492b4ea9e7bd775858ab2598e97edd68d4c22ef039691505566c90dea", "ja": "下馬評通り、千早の圧勝か？　それとも、静香が\n意地を見せるのか？　シャドウバウト、エンゲージ！", "zh": "正如赛前预测，千早会大获全胜吗？还是静香会展现不服输的一面？\n影之对决，开战！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1005_audience", "source_sha256": "f457e23efefb780efb90a8a45ee865277fabe64fe3a0ad83c2ba7c0f2ebd2e91", "ja": "ワアアアァァァァァァーッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1006_002chi", "source_sha256": "9d9214637b870cca560af2869fcfc51bac3cb93d367a520bf3883db5bc729168", "ja": "……ヘリオトロープの、静香。運がなかったわね。\n私と当たってしまうなんて。", "zh": "……日光花的静香。你的运气真不好。\n居然会和我对上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "65aad252f2f47b1cd5041e6d5a6345982bdcea73c0773e18e0e0f7b9b5ce63a4", "ja": "そうですか？　私は千早さんと戦いたかったですよ。\nだって……勝ち目がありそうでしたから。", "zh": "是吗？我其实很想和千早小姐交手。\n因为……感觉自己好像有胜算。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "7563ff1c20e269c901911f2244e7d97f3cf206f2eff6486388e6a95174a71289", "ja": "ふふ、言うじゃない。いいわ……\n私の戦具『青い鳥籠』、味わってみなさい。", "zh": "呵呵，挺会说嘛。好吧……你就好好领教一下我的战具《蓝色鸟笼》吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1009_se", "source_sha256": "de605174c03c1d2e9a3db25991f766bb093aa292c6aa693b16c617506c28df9d", "ja": "ガチャ、キイィ……\n……ヴンッ！", "zh": "咔嗒、吱呀……\n……嗡！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "6bc21660616a67a9539327ead08416a321be9074e249d646650fb05bf9d5a0cd", "ja": "くっ……！？　体が重い……\nこれが、千早さんの……鳥籠の力……！", "zh": "呃……！？身体好沉……\n这就是千早的……鸟笼之力……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "b9ff985d90393b9205c07a505585305c6694cea337d11c2d33eac0e84c7f72c7", "ja": "凄い圧力……あまり時間はなさそうね……。", "zh": "好强的压迫感……看来没剩多少时间了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1012_025roc", "source_sha256": "02863bd18d7e5cf38d7b084ed5ccabbcd2080d3da69b7666108f58d0e19842c2", "ja": "『青い鳥籠』は、範囲内に捉えた相手の力を奪い、\n戦具を使えなくさせる、オーサムな能力です。", "zh": "《蓝色鸟笼》是能夺走范围内捕获目标的力量，使其无法使用战斗装备的超棒能力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1013_025roc", "source_sha256": "c3885aee02555f90d9a1433fb182c1b5a2f4d39a3672c74e7336f3cf3534e6c8", "ja": "チハヤは今まで負け知らず。一方シズカは、勝率は\nよくありません。でも、ロコのリサーチによると……！", "zh": "千早至今未尝败绩。另一方面，静香的胜率并不高。不过，根据ROCO的调查……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1014_002chi", "source_sha256": "28d98bec01d11d6ed9521ea2aead36b15296e26a5efe3fbf274cbc3596d6c82e", "ja": "私の鳥籠に一度囚われたら、二度と飛ぶことは\nできない。大人しく降参したらどうかしら？", "zh": "一旦被囚禁在我的鸟笼里，就再也无法飞翔。你还是老老实实投降吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "5f5361a687206bd49fd0858b996b7dee8388b0a0ca26bd68cc6db41cee699edc", "ja": "ふふ、せっかくのデュエットなんですよ？\nそんなもったいないことしません……はあっ！", "zh": "呵呵，这可是难得的二重唱呀？我才不会做那么浪费的事……哈啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1016_se", "source_sha256": "770c850b9f0e3b3a4c9337c564adce30833627c69f45a387b52e4fa63ec213a8", "ja": "ズシンッ！", "zh": "沉闷一声！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1017_002chi", "source_sha256": "a696f1327f78ca7196ed53bf10b1f7e33e241319e74f1cd970313e9a0a453599", "ja": "っ！？　なに、この振動は……！？", "zh": "！？　这是什么震动……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "5b8b60f7fc8e2e4bb957718a8f00a23722f46914b38397e75a7094ac7b2333de", "ja": "何って、ただ踏み込んだだけです。", "zh": "什么？我只是踩了一下而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1019_002chi", "source_sha256": "0ecf8141c54ef36059582777ab9dc9279b5efd74dfcc42605cd08a6e71d6ee5e", "ja": "何か使ったの？　……いえ、違うわね。\n戦具の力は感じない。", "zh": "你使用了什么吗？……不，不对。\n我感觉不到战具的力量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1020_002chi", "source_sha256": "728ea5beb289e5d1853f5290b9a2a215506f8b5283eaec6359df69b154843728", "ja": "それどころか……貴女からは、\n戦具の反応、そのものがないわ。まさか、貴女……", "zh": "不仅如此……从你身上甚至感觉不到战具的反应。难道说，你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "ce6416431847f402ab918808cae4a01f78dafc199ccdaea6f3a8657447a248fa", "ja": "バレましたか。そうです、私は戦具を持っていません。\nその分、体を鍛えてますけど。", "zh": "被发现了吗？没错，我没有战具。\n不过，我也因此锻炼了身体。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1022_002chi", "source_sha256": "9b3f84ece109d7b8257c1e0a91cd79271607f2a4024a35f542825037b215d5d6", "ja": "戦具を持たない？　そんなことが……。", "zh": "不带战具？怎么会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1023_015siz", "source_sha256": "63d18e6b72c1d2970da7fd9824af1e5b8f354b6fd5026bbc4da4111603487f7c", "ja": "油断しましたね、千早さん！\nこの一撃で決めます！　……はああぁっ！", "zh": "您大意了，千早小姐！\n就用这一击决出胜负！……哈啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1024_se", "source_sha256": "55802282d7ca59cf9be989500ab8ae45d3318af12f07fdd365d5eb0e9b7b0b19", "ja": "ズドンッ！", "zh": "轰隆！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1025_002chi", "source_sha256": "781abb1e82628abd039ab73c1c943bc0264a61fb12d535801289ab319d487168", "ja": "なにっ！？　くっ。\n一直線にこちらに……ガードが、間に合わな……！", "zh": "什么！？唔。\n直冲这边而来……防御、来不及……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1026_se", "source_sha256": "88de784721eaac9166b37c551c1e5ecac68573e1c8a8383eb4304bb80fa33ec8", "ja": "ズガーンッ！！！！", "zh": "轰——！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1027_null", "source_sha256": "de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481", "ja": "翌日……", "zh": "隔天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1028_025roc", "source_sha256": "da76c22c318d4149d806f542e889b42860b4d4bbe1b7f3c48e1c088d982cc929", "ja": "号外（エクストラ）～！　号外です～！", "zh": "号外～！　出号外了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1029_025roc", "source_sha256": "79acd11cff2cd072fa61c5864620278d5d0f5dea71d0b39f8eb5d35213b6bbd8", "ja": "昨日の陰界戦戯（シャドウバウト）は見ましたか？\n見ていない？　ドントウォーリー！", "zh": "昨天的陰界戦戯（シャドウバウト）看了吗？\n没看？Don't worry！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1030_025roc", "source_sha256": "bceec9d2d05d97937dbedf541577587c928acd29c89d6e94db3363680f1a35e8", "ja": "それなら『ヘリオトロープタイムズ・エクストラ』を\nどうぞ！　フリーペーパーです～。", "zh": "那么请看《天芥菜时报·特刊》吧！是免费报纸哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1031_null", "source_sha256": "f167c1bf36dfac6fc87c4c2f833f83560c0405bfcaab1cbbb514e38e672f2459", "ja": "『最強の一角、千早敗れる！\n世紀の下剋上の相手はルーキー・静香！』", "zh": "『最强的一角，千早败北！\n世纪大逆袭的对手是新人静香！』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1032_null", "source_sha256": "55e63dd74a14569cb6bce5a0a9034f00f4b4b44b2e8a84a9469247c18009baaf", "ja": "『千早の強力な戦具を攻略し、捨て身の攻撃で\n無敵の守護神の膝に土をつけた……』", "zh": "『攻克千早的强力战具，以舍身攻击让无敌的守护神屈膝……』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1033_se", "source_sha256": "42164bb99a534ea3272bcdcb11f457642c0dc5396aaa505b28374d54c24d131a", "ja": "ザワザワ、ザワザワ……", "zh": "窸窸窣窣、窸窸窣窣……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1034_se", "source_sha256": "3fc2c38996c4964719077cc99347e3efa04028eae5df32741a9198aa80e56891", "ja": "ピピーッ！", "zh": "嘟——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1035_kidoufuukiiin", "source_sha256": "52ec8cf839c6e070b9c81344b9af99e902be7eda5654feab01c6abffed19d252", "ja": "コラーッ！　そこ、何を集まっている！\n今すぐ解散しなさいっ！！", "zh": "喂——！你们聚在那里干什么！现在立刻解散！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1036_kidoufuukiiin", "source_sha256": "c6af2cf2e269499611549e6aa1f976b882c8f4d41c913fd94ee5cd54fb92589d", "ja": "ヘリオトロープのロコだな！　動くな！", "zh": "是向日葵的ROCO啊！别动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1037_025roc", "source_sha256": "993b8cc47a48fb4bad74cf694b4dc34379f7f5ffbfec2ef037866d217f1d798e", "ja": "わわっ！　機動風紀委員が……\nここはエスケープが勝ち、シーユーです～♪", "zh": "哇哇！机动风纪委员居然……\n这种时候走为上策，先再见了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1038_kidoufuukiiin", "source_sha256": "48a25deb9a6cc8f8b1be775b0807eac0f42c7a873a394c86c6ec95cf7f069c32", "ja": "くっ！　毎度毎度、逃げ足の速いヤツだ……\n陰界の情報を陽界でばらまくなんて、とんでもない！", "zh": "可恶！每次都跑得真快……  \n竟敢把阴界的情报散播到阳界来，真是岂有此理！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1039_kidoufuukiiin", "source_sha256": "3f994d9d59441b76142bcfec1a800237c2414fedb50702188c7bf8ddb89d3092", "ja": "いつか絶対に、捕まえてやるぞ！", "zh": "总有一天，我绝对要抓住你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1041_025roc", "source_sha256": "b55c683372033657517c711345c3f0b8d327bb79720265066dffb48faed8ec06", "ja": "ふぅ、ここまで来れば安心……", "zh": "呼，到了这里就放心了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1042_038chz", "source_sha256": "9f1a9f50a1e06c01802103e2dbe16df4f2765ad73d54ad821185a7f36d64d285", "ja": "コロちゃん？　そんなに急いでどうかしましたの？\n転んだら危ないですわよ。", "zh": "CORO？这么急急忙忙的，是怎么了？摔倒了很危险哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1043_025roc", "source_sha256": "d9d45a6c8ba4ccabc4be9931ec64ec853970c64881ecdb24d45dd71bf2c7d09e", "ja": "チヅル！　いえ、それは……\nなんでもないんですよ、えへへ。", "zh": "千鹤！不，那个是……\n没什么啦，嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1044_015siz", "source_sha256": "e393b579556181efab6cb31139f76c4822bcb39489c56e36dee068302a43a291", "ja": "ロコ。まさか、また号外を\n配りに行ってたんじゃないでしょうね？", "zh": "ROCO。你该不会又去发号外了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1045_025roc", "source_sha256": "c80060d34620ac2d63c311722c9b74b5cac34d73497907caf325f1136a19632a", "ja": "はっ、シズカ！　そ、そんなことより、\nコングラチュレーションです！　取材させてください！", "zh": "啊，静香！　比、比起那个，恭喜你！请让我采访一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1046_038chz", "source_sha256": "3168edd3723836f7e52e1e638415ec11f37d55695c3dc4314280f4a71a33dbbe", "ja": "わたくしと静香は生徒会の活動があるので、\n終わってからにしてくださいまし。それでは。", "zh": "我和静香还有学生会的工作要做，请等我们结束之后再采访吧。那么，告辞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1047_025roc", "source_sha256": "ab5d6ec46d466b5868f20fce3c083ceb8c7820217d6e0eca92e161beacfc8e9e", "ja": "……ソーリーです、チヅル。たとえ機動風紀委員に\n目を付けられても、ロコはやめません！", "zh": "……十分抱歉，千鹤。就算被机动风纪委员盯上，我也不会放弃ROCO的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0418_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_01_1048_025roc", "source_sha256": "4d584065fd7dd0165c15e76188232c8a9768024e7a096468fa611910aae54dda", "ja": "この世界の真実をディスクロージャーする\nことが、新聞部員としてのロコのミッションですから！", "zh": "将这个世界的真相公之于众，  \n就是身为新闻部成员的ROCO的使命！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
